Option: games-B
Name: The Pick button also snips sunflowers (the Sunflower Whisperer badge on a phone)
Does: In summer every fourth press of the "Pick a blueberry" button snips a sunflower (if one is ready), and a snipped sunflower grows back in 3 to 5 seconds instead of 7 to 11 (js/hero.js). Only 5 sunflowers are drawn, at the edges of the picture, and a phone cannot reach them, so the 100 snips the badge needs were out of reach there; now a phone or a keyboard can earn it. Mouse clicks on the sunflowers work as before, and the other seasons are not touched. The patch adds one part to tests/games.test.mjs (a snipped sunflower is back after 5 seconds; the button alone earns the badge); no text changes.
Answers: d68 A (let the Pick button snip sunflowers too)
Conflicts: none
Requires: none
Host: any
Order: 80
Profile: filled
After: nothing to rebuild; upload again
Strings: none

